    "and web/src/store/golden.test.ts.",
    "",
    "Valid: a string variable, an alias of it in the same collection, a number, text bound to the alias",
    "and font size to the number, a number alias that lives in ANOTHER collection. Every op in `rejected`",
    "violates ONE invariant (alias of a missing variable, of a variable of another type, a cycle, an alias",
    "with values, a string variable holding a number, a string bound to a number key and the reverse): the",
    "scene MUST stay unchanged. Then the cascade: deleting the primitive deletes its alias and the text",
    "binding; the number, its cross-collection alias and their bindings stay."
